<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Novus Petroleum half year net jumps.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Novus Petroleum half year net jumps.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    24.00 vs 7.40</p>
<p>    Net					8.94 vs 3.04</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)			nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Sales				   57.42 vs 19.11</p>
<p>    Other income			   0.42 vs 0.42</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    8.50 vs 2.90</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		  loss 1.10 vs nil</p>
<p>    Tax				     13.96 vs 4.36</p>
<p>    Interest				 0.78 vs 0.22</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  14.22 vs 3.93</p>
<p>    Minorities				nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Novus Petroleum Ltd is an oil producer.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
